{
  "post": {
    "id": "5177566",
    "published": "2016-04-04T11:20:16.000Z",
    "title": "情報がいっぱいだよ！",
    "url": "https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/5177566.html",
    "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20170907045659/https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/5177566.html",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "こんばんは、鹿乃です"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "晚上好，我是鹿乃。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Good evening, I'm Kano"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "bfa42274c228.png",
            "source": "https://parts.lineblog.me/img/emoji/3/ic_cat02.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "東京は桜満開です。みんなの住んでいるところはどうですか？"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "东京正值樱花满开。大家住的地方樱花怎么样呢？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The cherry blossoms are in full bloom in Tokyo. How is it where you all live?"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "鹿乃は桜がとても好きなので、ちょっとしたお出掛けをするたび桜が見れてこの時期は幸せです。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "鹿乃非常喜欢樱花，所以每次稍微出趟门都能看到，这个季节真是幸福。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I love cherry blossoms so much that I get to see them every time I step out even a little, so this time of year makes me happy."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "今日は5月11日発売の鹿乃1stアルバム「nowhere」について諸々発表されましたね。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "今天公布了关于5月11日发售的鹿乃首张专辑《nowhere》的种种消息呢。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Today, all sorts of details were announced about my 1st album \"nowhere\", which comes out on May 11."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "RT、呟きをたくさんしたので通知？がいくようにしている方にはもしかしたら携帯ぶーぶーさせてご迷惑をおかけしたかもしれません。すみませんっ"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "我转推、发推发了很多，说不定让那些开着通知的朋友手机一直“嗡嗡”响个不停，给大家添麻烦了。对不起！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I retweeted and tweeted so much that if you have notifications turned on, your phone may have been buzzing away and I may have bothered you. Sorry!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "というわけで、スタート（？）です！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "那么，就此开始（？）啦！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "So, here we go (?)!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "youtube",
        "videoId": "B4kUkjdkCWg",
        "watch": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B4kUkjdkCWg",
        "video": "1c22f1a1fcce.mp4",
        "cover": "6255d1f4d2b1.jpg",
        "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20170907045659/https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B4kUkjdkCWg",
        "coverSource": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/B4kUkjdkCWg/hqdefault.jpg"
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "本日、アルバムから1曲目「プリマステラ」のショートver.が投稿されました。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "今天，专辑中第一首歌《Prima Stella》的短片版本已经公开了。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Today, a short version of the album's first track, \"Primastella\", was posted."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ぜひ聴いてください"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "请一定要听一听。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Please do listen to it"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "88f9715b680c.png",
            "source": "https://parts.lineblog.me/img/emoji/3/ic_chick.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "7e841cf20c3b.jpg",
            "source": "http://line.blogimg.jp/kano/imgs/0/b/0b014e98.jpg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "←左は初回限定版            右は通常盤 →"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "←左边是初回限定版            右边是通常盘 →"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Left is the first-press limited edition            Right is the regular edition →"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "＼ジャケットが公開されました／"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "＼封面公开啦／"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "＼The jackets have been revealed／"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "各店舗さまごとの購入特典情報＆リリース記念お渡し会情報（東京、名古屋、大阪）の詳細も合わせて発表されています。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "各家店铺的购买特典信息，以及发售纪念交付会（东京、名古屋、大阪）的详情也都一并公布了。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Details on the purchase bonuses at each store and on the release-commemoration handshake-and-hand-out events (Tokyo, Nagoya, Osaka) have been announced as well."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "詳しくは公式HP、もしくはお近くの対象店舗さまにお問い合わせしていただきますようよろしくお願いいたします。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "详情请查看官网，或咨询附近的活动对象店铺，麻烦大家了。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "For details, please check the official website or ask the participating store near you."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "link",
            "href": "http://whv-amusic.com/kano/",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "http://whv-amusic.com/kano/"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "アルバム発売まであと一ヶ月、Stella-rium発売からあともう少しで一年。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "距离专辑发售还有一个月，而从《Stella-rium》发售到现在再过不久也满一年了。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "One month until the album's release, and almost a year since Stella-rium came out."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "まだまだ苦手なことは多いですが、前よりは少しずつ色々なことができるようになってきました。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "虽然还有很多不擅长的事，但比起从前，已经一点点学会做各种事情了。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "There are still lots of things I'm bad at, but little by little I've become able to do more than before."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "4月から環境が変わって、人それぞれ大変なことがあるかと思います。が！一緒にこつこつ頑張っていきましょう。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "4月起环境会有所改变，想必大家各有各的难处。但是！让我们一起踏踏实实地努力吧。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Things changed for a lot of people in April, and I'm sure everyone has their own struggles. But! Let's keep working hard, steadily, together."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "私が必死にせっせっと活動していることで、誰かが頑張るか〜〜って少しでも思ってくれたら嬉しいです。おこがましいですが本音ですふふふ。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "如果我拼命努力活动的样子，能让大家哪怕有一点点“那我也要加把劲呀～～”的想法，我会非常开心。这话可能有点自大，但确实是真心话，嘻嘻。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If me busily working away like this makes someone think \"well, then I'll give it a try too,\" even a little, I'd be happy. It's presumptuous of me, but it's how I honestly feel, hehe."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ではでは、また！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "那么那么，下次见！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Well then, see you again!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "鹿乃"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "titleZh": "资讯满满哦！",
    "titleEn": "So much news!"
  },
